WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.570
ep 2

00:25.200 --> 00:26.560
Good morning, Itou!

00:26.560 --> 00:28.810
Itou, thanks for the other day.

00:29.920 --> 00:30.800
Good morning!

00:30.800 --> 00:32.920
Good morning, Itou!

00:32.920 --> 00:35.240
Itou, you going to the game?

00:35.240 --> 00:35.930
Yeah.

01:05.320 --> 01:07.130
Man...

01:07.670 --> 01:10.170
I'm happy I get them, but I already have Kyou.

01:13.380 --> 01:14.790
Wh-Why?

01:14.790 --> 01:17.340
Why's that little toad so popular?

01:26.060 --> 01:29.360
I can't believe

01:26.730 --> 01:26.810
To: Mitsuhashi

01:27.020 --> 01:29.360
I really

01:27.850 --> 01:29.360
got

01:27.850 --> 01:29.360
one!

01:29.890 --> 01:32.360
Hallelujah!

01:33.190 --> 01:35.810
Outta my way! Outta my way!

01:36.700 --> 01:36.780
Men's

01:39.820 --> 01:39.910
pied

01:39.910 --> 01:39.950
Occupied

01:49.670 --> 01:49.710
Stop celebrating, loser!

01:57.970 --> 01:59.640
Fuck it.

01:59.640 --> 02:00.610
I don't need...

02:00.610 --> 02:05.090
to have <i>anything to do with
women for the rest of my life!</i>

02:05.670 --> 02:08.880
Goddammit!

02:08.880 --> 02:15.400
Starting  today,  I'll!!

02:09.160 --> 02:15.400
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

02:15.400 --> 02:15.440
Starting  today,  I'll!!

02:15.530 --> 02:20.160
The Crimson Coward Against the Sunset

02:20.160 --> 02:24.620
Niko 39

02:20.160 --> 02:24.620
Get Your Chocolate at Niko

02:20.160 --> 02:24.620
Valentine's Day Sale

02:20.610 --> 02:21.750
He what?

02:21.750 --> 02:24.620
Mitsuhashi's got a girl?

02:25.070 --> 02:28.530
Pull the other one.

02:28.530 --> 02:32.420
There's no way that chicken-livered chancer could ever get a chick.

02:32.750 --> 02:35.990
True. But she's a transfer student.

02:35.990 --> 02:36.950
And?

02:36.950 --> 02:40.380
She probably hasn't realized how lame he is yet.

02:40.380 --> 02:44.400
Christ, who gives a rat's ass about that mook?

02:44.400 --> 02:45.930
Yeah, you said it.

02:45.930 --> 02:49.650
Uh, Imai, aren't you putting too many price tags on there?

02:49.660 --> 02:54.270
Shut it! I am not – I repeat, <i>not</i> –
letting that news get to me!

02:54.270 --> 02:55.880
I didn't say you were.

02:55.880 --> 02:56.880
Whatever...

02:56.880 --> 03:01.350
I don't give a flying fuck if Mitsuhashi's got a chick, knocked her up, or any shit like that!

03:01.350 --> 03:02.110
You got that?

03:04.410 --> 03:08.670
You said it didn't matter, so why do we have to nose around?

03:08.670 --> 03:11.740
What do you mean? It's pure coincidence that I decided to walk this way.

03:11.740 --> 03:15.430
So what's with the stealthy approach?

03:15.430 --> 03:19.460
There's a good reason for that... It's, um, yeah...

03:24.170 --> 03:26.500
Oh? Mitsuhashi, what are you doing he—

03:27.130 --> 03:28.470
What is it?

03:28.470 --> 03:29.360
What's got into you?

03:29.360 --> 03:32.120
Come out, Three!

03:29.360 --> 03:32.120
<b>Translation Note</b>: In written Japanese, the first kanji of Mitsuhashi's name means "three."

03:32.920 --> 03:35.330
There's no point hiding!

03:35.330 --> 03:38.720
There's no way you're getting out of it today!

03:41.680 --> 03:43.050
There he is!

03:46.070 --> 03:47.640
A hit!

04:01.700 --> 04:03.950
S-Sorry.

04:03.950 --> 04:06.030
Sh-She's cute...

04:06.990 --> 04:07.890
I'm in love...

04:09.360 --> 04:10.250
Imai.

04:11.080 --> 04:11.790
Imai!

04:11.790 --> 04:12.860
Hold on!

04:12.860 --> 04:14.720
Imai! Imai!

04:21.860 --> 04:24.620
What is this pang in my chest?

04:24.620 --> 04:27.200
You sure you don't just have a cracked rib?

04:28.790 --> 04:33.510
These palpitations have been
caused by the illumination of her love.

04:33.510 --> 04:35.220
Can't you see it?

04:35.220 --> 04:37.120
These amorous rays, full of hope...

04:37.120 --> 04:38.840
Nope. I see nothing.

04:39.590 --> 04:41.000
Tanigawa...

04:41.000 --> 04:41.560
Yes?

04:41.560 --> 04:45.190
We were destined to meet!

04:45.190 --> 04:46.640
I'll do it tomorrow.

04:46.910 --> 04:50.290
Yeah! That's the boss of Beni High I know, Imai!

04:51.280 --> 04:55.970
The tarot cards said tomorrow would be my lucky day...

05:01.260 --> 05:02.920
Oh look, it's Itou.

05:03.790 --> 05:04.780
Riko.

05:05.150 --> 05:07.010
Why are you so twitchy?

05:07.010 --> 05:09.610
He's probably up to no good like always.

05:09.610 --> 05:10.360
Ryou!

05:11.090 --> 05:12.700
Wh-Where's Mitsuhashi?

05:12.950 --> 05:14.690
He skipped out on his duties and ran off.

05:14.690 --> 05:15.750
Phew...

05:15.750 --> 05:16.570
What's up?

05:17.620 --> 05:19.490
Oh, it's nothing...

05:19.490 --> 05:21.120
Wait, I got it!

05:21.120 --> 05:22.440
You have a date with Kyouko!

05:22.440 --> 05:25.010
Oh, he's turning red.

05:25.770 --> 05:28.970
It's okay. I'll keep it a secret from Three.

05:28.970 --> 05:30.780
Really? Thank you.

05:30.780 --> 05:34.330
Wow, what exactly does she see in this goon?

05:35.010 --> 05:37.480
I'll clue you in sometime, Ryou.

05:37.480 --> 05:38.730
Later!

05:38.730 --> 05:40.910
Itou!

05:41.960 --> 05:43.450
Where'd ya go?

05:43.450 --> 05:45.410
Let's get a move on already!

05:46.370 --> 05:47.280
Hey!

05:48.690 --> 05:50.690
Yo. You guys seen Itou?

05:51.030 --> 05:53.000
Nope. Dunno where he is.

05:53.000 --> 05:56.430
Mitsuhashi! What the hell d'you think you're doing, skipping cleanup duty?

05:56.430 --> 05:57.770
Wh-What?

05:57.770 --> 05:59.540
I'm looking for Itou, of course!

05:59.540 --> 06:01.870
Itou! Where'd ya go?

06:02.440 --> 06:04.180
That dunderhead...

06:19.480 --> 06:25.280
Akasaka Dojo

06:44.910 --> 06:47.090
I'm saying you gotta apologize!

06:48.890 --> 06:51.050
You know who you're talking to, doll?

06:51.550 --> 06:54.010
What do you think you're playing at,
going around hitting people?!

06:54.010 --> 06:57.130
What? His face pissed me off, that's all.

06:57.130 --> 06:57.850
How exactly?!

06:58.170 --> 07:01.630
Guys like you are a black stain on this town!

07:02.020 --> 07:03.680
What'd you call us?!

07:03.680 --> 07:05.220
Say that again. I dare ya!

07:07.050 --> 07:07.640
What?

07:12.850 --> 07:13.810
You bitch!

07:23.710 --> 07:26.450
Wow! That was impressive. Top drawer stuff.

07:27.230 --> 07:28.600
Who's that?

07:28.600 --> 07:29.410
I dunno...

07:30.960 --> 07:33.050
You're pretty good for a girl.

07:34.990 --> 07:36.210
What do you train in?

07:36.210 --> 07:39.840
This is Riko, and she's gonna run Akasaka Dojo one day!

07:39.840 --> 07:42.120
She doesn't have to answer questions from someone like you!

07:42.120 --> 07:42.770
Oh?

07:43.260 --> 07:47.570
More to the point, I absolutely hate blond thugs like you.

07:48.960 --> 07:51.270
What? You're such a buzzkill.

07:51.830 --> 07:55.520
Do you talk to everyone like that?

07:55.520 --> 07:56.700
Depends on the person.

07:56.700 --> 07:57.490
What?

07:57.490 --> 08:02.320
You sit back when people are in trouble! You're a coward!

08:02.840 --> 08:03.820
You little whore!

08:03.130 --> 08:03.820
Watch out!

08:07.290 --> 08:09.490
I'm gonna gouge chunks outta you.

08:10.930 --> 08:12.540
Fuck. What was that?!

08:21.880 --> 08:24.030
Maybe I <i>am a bit of a coward.</i>

08:24.030 --> 08:26.960
I'm also a bully, selfish, and a whole bunch of other stuff.

08:26.960 --> 08:31.780
But compared to you, who calls me
a thug without even knowing me—

08:31.780 --> 08:33.270
Wh-What is it?

08:40.130 --> 08:41.990
U-Um...

08:42.760 --> 08:43.790
Thanks.

09:00.320 --> 09:03.720
Oh, man! That was pretty cheesy, wasn't it?!

09:03.720 --> 09:04.930
Gotta go!

09:08.080 --> 09:09.330
Weirdo.

09:34.330 --> 09:36.170
Imai, she's here!

09:36.880 --> 09:37.730
R-Right!

09:39.840 --> 09:41.290
You're gonna back out after all?

09:44.210 --> 09:45.430
Not a chance.

09:45.430 --> 09:48.130
I'm a man, and I'm doing this today!

09:51.940 --> 09:54.270
Until yesterday, I was living in darkness.

09:54.270 --> 09:58.090
But your radiance has ushered me into a beautiful dawn.

09:58.090 --> 10:02.800
Where a barren wasteland stood yesterday,
now it is teeming with life, due to your light.

10:02.800 --> 10:06.330
Riko, I... I...

10:19.520 --> 10:21.230
Um...

10:21.670 --> 10:25.300
Sorry about calling you all the way out here.

10:25.760 --> 10:26.770
No...

10:27.120 --> 10:30.230
I injured you the other day too, so...

10:30.230 --> 10:31.440
Oh, that!

10:31.440 --> 10:33.190
That was nothing.

10:33.190 --> 10:35.060
U-Um...

10:35.060 --> 10:37.810
Do you, um...

10:39.170 --> 10:41.490
like anybody?

10:41.830 --> 10:42.970
Huh?

10:42.970 --> 10:44.070
Oh you!

10:44.070 --> 10:45.190
Where did <i>that come from?</i>

10:46.070 --> 10:48.710
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!

10:52.560 --> 10:55.430
It's not M-M-M...

10:55.430 --> 10:58.890
M-M-Mitsu...

10:58.890 --> 11:00.810
Things sure are heating up.

11:00.810 --> 11:03.250
...M-Mitsuhashi, is it?!

11:12.020 --> 11:14.490
H-He's a surprisingly nice guy.

11:18.050 --> 11:19.700
And it's over.

11:19.700 --> 11:20.450
Yup.

11:25.060 --> 11:26.230
Huh? Imai?

11:27.530 --> 11:28.630
Imai!

11:29.090 --> 11:30.710
Hey, Imai!

11:41.590 --> 11:45.090
Imai, let's go home already.

11:46.670 --> 11:47.710
Hey!

11:53.170 --> 11:55.210
Wh-What did <i>I do?</i>

11:55.210 --> 11:56.220
You stupid shit!

11:56.790 --> 11:58.800
I'm after Mayumi!

11:58.800 --> 12:00.810
What the hell're you thinking, writing her a letter?

12:00.810 --> 12:01.520
I like her!

12:01.520 --> 12:02.370
What?

12:02.370 --> 12:03.890
I like Mayumi!

12:03.890 --> 12:05.750
What?! You—

12:09.950 --> 12:11.790
Who the fuck are you?

12:12.390 --> 12:14.490
What's wrong with liking someone?

12:15.410 --> 12:17.320
You bastard. Just who do you think you are—

12:17.830 --> 12:20.090
What the hell's wrong with liking someone?! Huh?!

12:20.500 --> 12:23.110
Don't fuck with us! We're from Akehisa!

12:23.110 --> 12:24.280
So what?!

12:24.280 --> 12:25.050
What?

12:25.330 --> 12:28.500
It's because of guys like you that the world's rotten to the core!

12:31.150 --> 12:34.590
I'm Imai from Beni High. You got a problem with me, come settle it whenever you like!

12:34.590 --> 12:38.000
Y-You bastard. Don't think you're gonna get away with this!

12:41.890 --> 12:46.090
And so, it is decided. My path is the path of a true man, after all.

12:46.560 --> 12:49.400
Those guys were from
Akehisa, the super gang!

12:49.400 --> 12:51.810
Do you understand, Imai?

12:51.810 --> 12:53.070
Akehisa?

12:53.410 --> 12:56.540
High

12:55.370 --> 12:56.290
School

13:05.020 --> 13:07.460
He didn't even twitch when we said we were from Akehisa.

13:08.020 --> 13:09.740
He dissed us, man!

13:11.170 --> 13:15.090
So you're saying you just ran away and left Nimura?

13:17.010 --> 13:18.200
Sagara...

13:18.680 --> 13:22.190
Beni High's Imai has a reputation, so...

13:22.190 --> 13:25.030
But you <i>still ran away, didn't you?</i>

13:26.470 --> 13:28.940
You pathetic, little scrote!

13:33.460 --> 13:37.110
This school is known for its brutish bruisers, not its scholars.

13:37.110 --> 13:40.390
If people think they can walk all over us, then we have nothing!

13:40.390 --> 13:42.760
Sorry! Sorry!

13:42.760 --> 13:44.660
Bring that motherfucker Imai here.

13:46.370 --> 13:48.710
C-Come off it, man! You know I can't—

13:49.440 --> 13:53.780
You useless dog! I'm telling you to clean up your mess!

13:55.610 --> 13:58.590
Rooster, go fetch everyone who's available.

13:58.920 --> 13:59.810
'Kay.

14:00.320 --> 14:02.360
It's time to kick some ass.

14:02.360 --> 14:04.850
And I just <i>love kicking ass.</i>

14:06.370 --> 14:07.370
Station

14:06.370 --> 14:07.370
Shopping

14:06.370 --> 14:07.330
District

14:06.370 --> 14:07.330
Valentine Thrills

14:07.330 --> 14:07.370
District

14:07.370 --> 14:07.410
Station

14:13.050 --> 14:14.970
Dammit...

14:14.970 --> 14:17.300
I'm not getting any attention this episode.

14:17.300 --> 14:18.990
I thought I was the main character.

14:19.380 --> 14:20.950
Maybe they figure I'm too strong...

14:21.560 --> 14:23.580
Valentine's Day is coming up, isn't it?

14:29.830 --> 14:31.520
I know this guy!

14:31.520 --> 14:33.620
What's this? If it isn't Tanigawa!

14:33.620 --> 14:34.640
Hey!

14:34.640 --> 14:36.160
What happened to you?!

14:36.160 --> 14:38.000
Hello in there!

14:38.000 --> 14:40.960
If you don't answer, I'm going to draw on your face.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.640
Is that all right?

14:42.640 --> 14:44.150
Hey! Mitsuhashi!

14:43.930 --> 14:46.850
Idiot

14:48.040 --> 14:49.790
Mitsuhashi?

14:49.790 --> 14:53.480
No, I wasn't the one who drew on you.

14:54.130 --> 14:55.190
Imai...

14:55.190 --> 14:55.950
What?

14:55.950 --> 14:58.370
They took Imai.

14:59.160 --> 14:59.900
Who did?

14:59.900 --> 15:01.880
Those bastards from Akehisa.

15:01.880 --> 15:02.830
What the hell?

15:03.260 --> 15:06.830
Akehisa is the worst school for thugs in this whole area!

15:07.950 --> 15:11.360
I beg you: Go save Imai.

15:11.360 --> 15:12.580
No way, Jose.

15:12.580 --> 15:13.290
What?

15:13.290 --> 15:14.630
Mitsuhashi!

15:14.630 --> 15:15.850
Please.

15:15.850 --> 15:19.400
Why on earth should I go save him?

15:19.400 --> 15:21.050
Mitsuhashi...

15:21.050 --> 15:22.350
Give it up.

15:23.070 --> 15:24.390
T-Tanigawa!

15:24.390 --> 15:25.600
Are you okay?

15:25.600 --> 15:26.930
Three, where are you going?

15:26.930 --> 15:28.890
Home. What a drag.

15:28.890 --> 15:31.440
Mitsuhashi! You maggot!

15:30.270 --> 15:31.440
Three!

15:33.660 --> 15:36.160
You guys look after Tanigawa.

15:41.170 --> 15:42.570
Where are you taking me?

15:43.760 --> 15:47.290
You came with us, even though there are three of us?

15:47.290 --> 15:50.290
You'd better stop looking down your nose at Akehisa!

15:51.090 --> 15:53.630
You're gonna fight over your school's name?

15:53.630 --> 15:54.750
Akehisa?

15:55.280 --> 15:56.910
What did you just say?!

15:56.910 --> 15:58.730
You're the one picking the fight here!

15:59.340 --> 16:03.690
Or is strength in numbers and talking big the only thing Akehisa's good for?

16:04.700 --> 16:05.650
Here we go.

16:05.960 --> 16:06.810
Hey!

16:09.330 --> 16:10.870
Ah! Sorry!

16:10.870 --> 16:13.390
I don't like it when people have their backs turned to me!

16:13.390 --> 16:15.870
Who the fuck are you?

16:16.640 --> 16:19.650
Bring it. We'll have ourselves a one-on-one.

16:19.650 --> 16:21.610
You... rat bastard!

16:31.620 --> 16:32.050
Dammit...

16:37.250 --> 16:39.230
Well, this is boring.

16:39.230 --> 16:41.730
Looks like Beni High's boss ain't nothing special.

16:43.080 --> 16:45.230
Hey, that's all you've got?

16:45.230 --> 16:48.050
You're hella weak for someone your size!

16:48.720 --> 16:50.600
You bastard...

16:50.600 --> 16:52.610
I'm not gonna lose...

16:54.620 --> 16:56.770
Sagara, I think that's enough.

16:56.770 --> 16:57.930
You'll kill him otherwise.

16:57.930 --> 16:59.610
You think so?

17:02.130 --> 17:06.230
You said you could take 'em all on, but you ended up being beaten by little ol' me.

17:06.230 --> 17:09.110
Guess I'm just <i>that strong.</i>

17:18.200 --> 17:18.890
Sorry I'm late.

17:19.240 --> 17:20.560
S-Sagara...

17:20.560 --> 17:21.730
Who the fuck are you?

17:22.180 --> 17:24.730
The hero of the people: Mitsuhashi Takashi!

17:25.540 --> 17:26.970
You're Nanyou's...

17:26.970 --> 17:27.840
...Mitsuhashi?

17:27.840 --> 17:30.190
Hey, punk! Get the fuck off him!

17:31.500 --> 17:33.590
Oh, my bad.

17:33.590 --> 17:34.310
Oopsy-daisy.

17:34.310 --> 17:36.650
That little shithead's dissing us!

17:37.040 --> 17:40.110
Do you even know who you're picking a fight with?

17:40.860 --> 17:43.830
I'm not really picking a fight, but...

17:44.410 --> 17:50.030
I was watching from that window and got pissed off, so I jumped down to join the fun.

17:50.430 --> 17:51.490
Mitsuhashi!

17:51.490 --> 17:51.990
I mean,

17:51.990 --> 17:54.330
things like that happen all the time, don't they?

17:54.330 --> 17:55.350
What'd you say?!

17:55.350 --> 17:56.330
You fuckwit!

18:03.220 --> 18:04.670
Damn, that smarts!

18:04.670 --> 18:06.570
You asshole!

18:09.020 --> 18:10.360
Are you all right?

18:10.360 --> 18:12.690
Yeah, he just caught me off guard.

18:13.930 --> 18:17.450
So this is Akehisa, huh? They're pretty strong.

18:21.680 --> 18:23.360
You bastard!

18:23.360 --> 18:24.790
We'll cut you down to size!

18:26.210 --> 18:27.300
Hey, Imai!

18:27.300 --> 18:28.860
How long you gonna lie there?! Let's show 'em!

18:29.830 --> 18:31.130
You prick!

18:36.520 --> 18:37.330
Don't tell me...

18:40.320 --> 18:42.770
Don't tell me he came to rescue me...

18:48.990 --> 18:50.830
That nancy boy, Mitsuhashi...

18:50.830 --> 18:51.730
Surely he hasn't...

18:55.050 --> 18:57.050
He's a surprisingly nice guy.

18:57.050 --> 18:59.050
He's a surprisingly nice guy.

18:59.050 --> 19:00.570
He's a surprisingly nice guy.

19:01.730 --> 19:03.060
I see.

19:03.560 --> 19:05.540
I hadn't seen it, Mitsuhashi...

19:05.540 --> 19:08.490
You... You're... a good person!

19:08.930 --> 19:09.890
Mitsuhashi!

19:09.890 --> 19:11.910
I... I...

19:13.580 --> 19:16.450
You have touched me deeply!

19:22.170 --> 19:23.280
Hey!

19:23.280 --> 19:24.800
Are you the ones causing a disturbance?!

19:25.130 --> 19:25.750
Oh crap.

19:25.750 --> 19:26.270
Let's get outta here!

19:26.270 --> 19:27.290
Imai! Don't just stand there!

19:27.290 --> 19:28.170
R-Right!

19:33.180 --> 19:34.390
Mitsuhashi!

19:39.570 --> 19:41.170
Dammit.

19:43.730 --> 19:45.710
This is bad. What're we gonna do?

19:48.740 --> 19:50.610
Imai, can you swim?

19:51.610 --> 19:52.800
Y-Yeah...

19:52.800 --> 19:55.330
For you, I'd swim across the Pacific!

19:56.440 --> 19:57.800
I see.

19:58.810 --> 20:01.890
Mitsuhashi, I am no longer a delinquent.

20:01.890 --> 20:03.810
I can leave Riko in your hands.

20:03.810 --> 20:06.010
Ah, I see, I see.

20:06.010 --> 20:07.730
Make her happy.

20:08.510 --> 20:10.270
What are you doing, Mitsuhashi?

20:10.270 --> 20:13.260
Okay, so I've put this right here, you see?

20:13.260 --> 20:14.400
Yeah.

20:14.400 --> 20:17.160
Now, you're going to accompany it into the river.

20:17.170 --> 20:18.010
Huh?

20:18.010 --> 20:19.010
What then?

20:19.010 --> 20:20.310
And then...

20:20.310 --> 20:23.190
You drowning will save my ass!

20:23.190 --> 20:24.910
What?

20:29.400 --> 20:32.330
Ah! Save me! I'm drowning!

20:32.650 --> 20:35.930
Imai, I won't let your sacrifice be in vain.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.280
Hey!

20:37.280 --> 20:39.860
I've got you now, you little troublemaker...

20:39.860 --> 20:42.100
It's terrible! My friend fell into the river!

20:42.100 --> 20:42.750
He can't swim!

20:42.750 --> 20:43.830
What?

20:43.830 --> 20:45.610
I'll save you!

20:44.250 --> 20:44.870
Gah!

20:46.480 --> 20:49.820
All right! Go for it! I'm counting on you!

20:52.130 --> 20:53.720
I was stupid...

20:53.720 --> 20:57.840
I was stupid for believing in him for even a second.

21:02.930 --> 21:04.230
What's with you?

21:04.230 --> 21:06.340
You should have invited Riko too.

21:06.340 --> 21:07.440
Shut up.

21:07.440 --> 21:10.280
You get stubborn about the weirdest things.

21:10.280 --> 21:12.570
I think that describes Mitsuhashi to a T...

21:13.090 --> 21:17.690
I think you've got the wrong idea, don't
you? There's nothing going on between—

21:18.700 --> 21:21.370
You're so defensive, Mitsuhashi.

21:22.650 --> 21:23.450
Oh balls.

21:26.280 --> 21:27.920
Aren't they from Akehisa?

21:28.850 --> 21:31.890
You didn't have a run-in with Akehisa, did you?

21:33.450 --> 21:35.350
That's, um, er...

21:35.970 --> 21:39.430
That school's dangerous. I told you not to mess with them, didn't I?

21:39.430 --> 21:42.920
Yeah, but there was this one guy there I really couldn't stand.

21:42.920 --> 21:46.270
Anyway, if we join forces, I'm sure it'll all work out.

21:46.270 --> 21:46.890
What?

21:49.980 --> 21:51.280
No fighting.

21:51.280 --> 21:53.060
Yeah, I know.

21:53.680 --> 21:56.410
Sorry, but I have nothing to do with this.

21:56.680 --> 21:57.680
Huh?

21:57.680 --> 21:59.460
Sort it out yourself.

21:59.460 --> 22:00.600
Bye.

22:00.600 --> 22:02.740
C'mon, man! That's so cold.

22:03.370 --> 22:04.450
Hey!

22:06.290 --> 22:07.530
Oops.

22:10.990 --> 22:12.880
Where's Mitsuhashi?

22:12.880 --> 22:14.170
I-I don't know.

22:14.560 --> 22:16.400
You go to Nanyou, don't you?!

22:16.400 --> 22:18.160
There's no way you wouldn't know.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.370
C-Come on!

22:19.370 --> 22:20.150
Stop!

22:20.680 --> 22:22.150
Get your dirty hands off of him, you thugs!

22:22.850 --> 22:24.180
Who the hell're you?

22:24.180 --> 22:27.110
This one's a jumped-up little squirt, ain't he?

22:27.110 --> 22:28.610
I have martial arts training!

22:29.080 --> 22:30.570
Well, that's just swell.

22:31.030 --> 22:34.100
If you carry on mocking me,
you'll be in for a whole world of pain!

22:41.200 --> 22:41.750
Ryou!

22:42.550 --> 22:44.010
What happened, Ryou?

22:44.010 --> 22:46.070
This has nothing to do with you!

22:48.250 --> 22:49.670
Looks like he was all bark and no bite.

22:50.720 --> 22:51.630
Akehisa?

22:52.790 --> 22:57.100
Hey, Spikes, why don't you go fetch Mitsuhashi for me?

22:58.340 --> 22:59.890
What do you want with Mitsuhashi?

23:00.600 --> 23:04.610
He attacked me from behind.

23:04.610 --> 23:06.150
I feel for you, man.

23:06.620 --> 23:09.840
So now, we're gonna teach him some manners.

23:09.840 --> 23:11.170
So go get him already.

23:11.780 --> 23:12.610
Hell no.

23:12.610 --> 23:13.460
What?!

23:13.460 --> 23:14.710
Itou!

23:16.170 --> 23:18.570
Kyou, look after Ryou.

23:18.570 --> 23:20.010
Itou.

23:20.620 --> 23:24.530
Don't sweat it. I just wanna find out what "manners" these guys want to teach.

23:27.260 --> 23:30.610
Nanyou's got a helluva lot of comedians, don't it?

23:30.610 --> 23:33.130
Okay, we'll tell you what you wanna know. Come with us.

23:33.540 --> 23:34.490
Lead on.

23:35.410 --> 23:36.730
Itou, wait.

23:36.730 --> 23:39.150
I need to settle this.

23:39.960 --> 23:42.750
It's fine. Leave it to me.

23:43.840 --> 23:43.890
No Trespassing

23:43.840 --> 23:43.890
Games Are Prohibited

23:43.840 --> 23:43.890
Danger

23:43.840 --> 23:43.890
Fukoso Construction KK

23:50.450 --> 23:52.530
First, my question:

23:52.530 --> 23:55.490
Are you friends with that chickenshit?

23:55.490 --> 24:00.740
Mitsuhashi may be the kind of coward who'd attack someone from behind—

24:04.070 --> 24:05.830
Pay attention, dumbass!

24:06.760 --> 24:08.290
Bastard...

24:08.650 --> 24:10.770
What the fuck are you looking at?

24:10.770 --> 24:12.250
You're pissing me off!

24:15.250 --> 24:16.890
Hey, what's wrong?

24:17.410 --> 24:18.060
Hm?

24:18.060 --> 24:19.790
You Nanyou motherfucker!

24:19.790 --> 24:21.630
C'mon! C'mon!

24:25.880 --> 24:27.560
Don't overexert yourself.

24:27.560 --> 24:28.670
I'm fine.

24:28.670 --> 24:29.520
But...

24:29.520 --> 24:33.310
I don't want to be indebted to a thug like Itou.

24:33.310 --> 24:34.490
Ryou!

24:44.100 --> 24:48.130
What did Spikes say his name was before we left him for dead?

24:48.690 --> 24:50.410
It was Itou or something like that.

24:50.410 --> 24:53.090
Who cares? He was no
match for Sagara, right?

24:53.360 --> 24:55.090
'Course he wasn't.

24:55.090 --> 24:57.430
As if I'd get whaled on by Nanyou scum.

24:58.450 --> 25:01.770
Yeah. Next, we'll go teach that—

25:02.340 --> 25:03.820
Huh? What's up?

25:07.610 --> 25:08.390
Hi.

25:09.170 --> 25:09.850
You...

25:10.200 --> 25:13.310
Don't think you've won just yet!

25:15.060 --> 25:15.690
You little shit!

25:21.990 --> 25:23.030
What's wrong?!

25:40.750 --> 25:42.930
I-Isn't that going a bit overboard, Sagara?

25:43.690 --> 25:45.250
Quit flapping your gums...

25:45.250 --> 25:46.400
I'm leaving.

25:46.400 --> 25:48.010
S-Sagara!

25:51.980 --> 25:52.390
Ow...

25:53.040 --> 25:55.840
Don't overdo it. Let's go home.

25:55.840 --> 25:57.230
Kyouko.

25:57.230 --> 25:57.890
What?

25:57.890 --> 26:01.370
How did a nice girl like you get mixed up with someone like Itou?

26:06.050 --> 26:12.920
Despite his appearance, he'd never
actually do anything immoral or untoward.

26:21.270 --> 26:24.220
Sagara, are you sure you didn't kill that guy?

26:24.760 --> 26:28.510
Even if he's pushing up daisies, nobody'll know it was us if you keep your trap shut.

26:33.240 --> 26:35.150
We have unfinished business.

26:35.570 --> 26:37.030
Th-This guy...

26:39.190 --> 26:40.130
Hey!

26:41.980 --> 26:43.950
What the hell are you? A demon?!

26:45.450 --> 26:48.410
I have trouble sleeping after being beaten up by scumbags.

26:49.900 --> 26:51.170
Really?

26:51.700 --> 26:54.370
Then, I'll make it so that you never wake up again.

26:55.060 --> 26:56.160
Take your best shot.

26:56.160 --> 26:57.780
You bastard...

26:57.780 --> 26:59.470
Don't get so cocky!

27:29.830 --> 27:31.370
Itou!

27:43.890 --> 27:45.750
Satoshi. This is the guy.

27:52.030 --> 27:53.590
Uh-oh, I'm in trouble...

27:54.350 --> 27:55.530
Sagara.

27:56.240 --> 27:58.430
So you laid Sagara out, huh?

27:59.860 --> 28:00.890
Looks like.

28:01.290 --> 28:03.140
What a surprise.

28:03.140 --> 28:06.800
I figured only losers went to Nanyou.

28:06.800 --> 28:08.230
Hey, what's your name?

28:09.850 --> 28:11.150
Who the hell are you?

28:11.150 --> 28:14.510
You fucker! How dare you say that to Akehisa's leader!

28:15.790 --> 28:19.840
I am Katagiri Satoshi, the don of Akehisa.

28:20.410 --> 28:21.970
Oh, it's you, is it?

28:21.970 --> 28:25.390
The kid who bragged about taking out gang members as a middle-schooler?

28:27.810 --> 28:29.360
That's in the past.

28:29.360 --> 28:32.350
All right, your turn. Introduce yourself.

28:33.350 --> 28:35.810
Itou... Itou Shinji.

28:35.810 --> 28:41.280
Good. Now, let's have a duel, Itou.
If you win, I'll let you off easy this time.

28:42.360 --> 28:43.530
Yeah, as if.

28:44.010 --> 28:45.150
What's wrong?

28:45.150 --> 28:47.230
Too chicken for a little one-on-one?

28:48.640 --> 28:49.490
Suppose I have to...

28:49.490 --> 28:50.650
Itou!

28:50.950 --> 28:52.330
Let's do this!

28:52.600 --> 28:53.280
Stop!

29:03.810 --> 29:05.790
S-So strong...

29:07.010 --> 29:09.050
Guess I overestimated him...

29:09.050 --> 29:09.750
Well, this should do—

29:09.750 --> 29:12.930
No, I'm not satisfied yet.

29:14.080 --> 29:15.770
Leave the rest to me.

29:19.640 --> 29:21.910
You sure rubbed my face in it, didn't you?

29:21.910 --> 29:23.470
Now, apologize.

29:25.540 --> 29:28.730
Say, "I'm really sorry, Master Sagara!"

29:30.670 --> 29:33.290
You sure are a scuzzbag, aren't you?

29:33.290 --> 29:34.530
You still don't get it, do you?!

29:34.530 --> 29:36.030
Stop!

29:36.340 --> 29:37.360
Please, no more!

29:37.360 --> 29:39.490
If you hurt him any more, he'll die!

29:39.910 --> 29:41.380
Who's this whore?

29:41.380 --> 29:42.850
Get outta the way.

29:42.850 --> 29:46.460
Anyone who stands up to us has to apologize afterwards!

29:47.060 --> 29:48.080
He's had enough.

29:48.590 --> 29:50.220
You little slut.

29:50.220 --> 29:52.100
Shall I make you cry first?

29:52.100 --> 29:52.550
Well?

29:52.920 --> 29:54.410
K-Kyou!

29:57.610 --> 30:00.750
Whaddaya say? Don't you care what happens to her?

30:00.750 --> 30:02.510
P-Please stop it.

30:03.300 --> 30:05.490
Please don't hurt her.

30:06.030 --> 30:09.810
Oh? So you can be polite, after all.

30:11.060 --> 30:15.850
If you don't hurry up and
apologize, I'll break her arm.

30:16.760 --> 30:19.450
Well, what's it gonna be? Speak up!

30:24.690 --> 30:25.410
Itou!

30:40.000 --> 30:44.370
P-Please... forgive me.

30:58.250 --> 31:01.360
What's up with you? You get beat up again?

31:06.060 --> 31:08.710
M-Mitsuhashi.

31:09.020 --> 31:13.470
Didn't I tell you that you shouldn't fight because you're a weakling?

31:15.780 --> 31:17.950
I... misjudged him.

31:18.380 --> 31:19.890
Huh? Who?

31:22.050 --> 31:23.350
Itou is...

31:26.000 --> 31:28.230
Itou's a good person, after all!

31:37.950 --> 31:40.280
Hey, are you sure you're okay?

31:40.280 --> 31:42.260
Yeah, they're just scratches.

31:42.910 --> 31:44.090
Are you sure?

31:44.090 --> 31:45.410
I'm sure.

31:45.410 --> 31:46.570
Are you really sure?

31:46.570 --> 31:49.710
Really sure. I'm just fi—

31:52.360 --> 31:54.670
That hurt! What the hell are you doing?!

31:54.670 --> 31:57.210
Didn't you just say you were fine?

31:57.210 --> 31:58.130
Mitsuhashi.

31:58.910 --> 32:01.190
What's going on here?

32:01.190 --> 32:04.620
Don't tell me you lost a fight. Well?

32:04.620 --> 32:06.110
Th-That's... uh, yeah...

32:06.560 --> 32:07.970
A-Ah, I know!

32:07.970 --> 32:12.850
I was looking at another girl and Kyou got really angry, so that's why I'm all beat up.

32:12.850 --> 32:14.230
Right?

32:14.230 --> 32:18.080
U-Um, yeah! I guess I don't know my own strength.

32:18.080 --> 32:19.920
Hm...

32:20.810 --> 32:26.130
She shoved me all of a sudden,
and threw rocks at me and bit me...

32:33.590 --> 32:35.710
How the mighty hath fallen, Itou.

32:35.710 --> 32:38.080
To think that you'd get beaten up by a girl.

32:38.770 --> 32:42.160
I'm so disappointed. Dismayed, even.

32:42.160 --> 32:44.040
I have no words.

32:51.560 --> 32:52.870
Think he suspected anything?

33:06.030 --> 33:08.570
Itou's a good person, after all!

33:09.160 --> 33:12.010
There's something fishy going on here.

33:17.900 --> 33:18.770
Three!

33:26.650 --> 33:29.560
Hi, Three. Where are you off to?

33:32.650 --> 33:36.100
Hi, Three. Where are you off to?

33:38.110 --> 33:41.480
Hi, Three. Where are you off to?

33:49.570 --> 33:50.870
What a drama queen.

33:51.270 --> 33:53.310
What the hell are you doing, you little hoebag?!

33:53.310 --> 33:55.110
You were ignoring me!

33:55.110 --> 33:57.710
You were so small, I couldn't see you!

33:57.970 --> 33:59.950
Well, <i>excuse me</i>, I'm sure.

34:01.030 --> 34:02.430
So where are you going?

34:04.650 --> 34:06.390
It's none of your damn business.

34:06.670 --> 34:08.850
What? Can't you just tell me?

34:08.850 --> 34:11.310
Shut it. I'm just going home.

34:11.330 --> 34:12.250
You're lying!

34:12.250 --> 34:15.060
It must have something to do with Ryou's injuries!

34:15.060 --> 34:15.490
Tell me already—

34:15.490 --> 34:16.530
Shut up!

34:17.330 --> 34:20.250
Quit sticking your nose in where it doesn't belong.

34:20.250 --> 34:21.670
Stop bothering me and go home.

34:21.670 --> 34:22.830
You hear?

34:23.330 --> 34:25.220
W-Wait, Three...

34:44.840 --> 34:46.510
Oh, sorry 'bout that.

34:46.980 --> 34:48.470
Who the hell are you?

34:50.540 --> 34:53.040
I guess I can't blame you for not remembering.

34:53.040 --> 34:55.350
That one-hit K.O. <i>was from behind...</i>

34:56.940 --> 34:58.310
So you're Mitsuhashi?

34:59.600 --> 35:02.770
You've got balls coming here on your own.

35:04.010 --> 35:06.070
If you want to thank me, you can start by bowing.

35:07.150 --> 35:09.100
Still talking trash, huh?

35:09.560 --> 35:14.030
Hey, I'm gonna go out to the usual place and play for a bit.

35:18.430 --> 35:20.370
Let's go. I'll be your opponent.

35:20.830 --> 35:21.820
Sure.

35:27.280 --> 35:29.770
It's no good. Riko isn't home yet either.

35:29.770 --> 35:30.860
Really?

35:31.560 --> 35:37.600
Don't tell me Mitsuhashi went looking for a fight with Akehisa and Riko tagged along.

35:38.310 --> 35:40.360
Ryou, let's go look for the two of them!

35:41.210 --> 35:41.810
Yeah.

35:54.030 --> 35:56.390
And to think, you came out here all by yourself.

35:56.390 --> 35:58.290
I ain't here for no class picnic.

35:58.290 --> 36:00.010
I'll be plenty enough to take you on.

36:07.910 --> 36:10.200
We'll get no audience up here.

36:10.660 --> 36:13.050
Whatever happens, nobody'll be around to stop us.

36:14.010 --> 36:15.930
So you mean we get to take this as far as we like.

36:15.930 --> 36:18.350
Look at you, getting ideas above your station.

36:18.660 --> 36:19.990
Don't count your chickens!

36:21.710 --> 36:22.770
Bastard...

36:23.480 --> 36:25.310
Good, that's right. Follow me.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.210
Wait!

36:30.490 --> 36:31.610
Wait!

36:36.200 --> 36:38.970
Mitsuhashi, don't let your guard down!

36:40.840 --> 36:42.510
Come on, come on.

36:44.370 --> 36:45.460
Come get it!

37:10.040 --> 37:10.870
You dipshit!

37:14.120 --> 37:15.240
M-Motherfucker!

37:16.870 --> 37:19.710
If that's how you want to play it.
Fighting dirty's my specialty.

37:20.850 --> 37:22.390
Cocksucker!

37:29.890 --> 37:31.060
Itou.

37:31.060 --> 37:33.420
Don't tell me that you went off to pay them back for yesterday.

37:34.110 --> 37:34.890
Hey, you.

37:36.030 --> 37:37.810
Well, well, if it isn't that chick from yesterday.

37:39.150 --> 37:41.310
Why are you out on your own?

37:43.540 --> 37:45.560
You look like you could use a little company!

37:46.060 --> 37:48.990
In that case, how about hanging out with us?

37:48.990 --> 37:50.700
Stop it!

37:50.700 --> 37:53.840
We'll please you way more than that spiky-haired goofball ever could!

37:53.840 --> 37:54.960
Stop!

37:58.630 --> 37:59.600
Who's that?!

38:01.160 --> 38:04.820
I can't stand lowlifes who pick on girls.

38:05.330 --> 38:07.050
Get your hands off her.

38:07.340 --> 38:08.820
I-Imai!

38:08.820 --> 38:11.010
Who the fuck do you think <i>you are?!</i>

38:11.350 --> 38:15.040
You're meant to protect
women, not terrify them.

38:15.040 --> 38:16.970
You're so cool, Imai!

38:16.970 --> 38:18.300
Fuck you!

38:24.330 --> 38:27.110
Akehisa is full of candyasses anyway.

38:27.110 --> 38:28.780
You'd better get outta here.

38:29.450 --> 38:30.400
Okay.

38:30.400 --> 38:31.960
Thank you very much!

38:31.960 --> 38:32.730
No sweat.

38:33.530 --> 38:36.290
That was totally rad, Imai!

38:36.290 --> 38:38.330
Keep this up and soon, Mitsuhashi will be eating sidewalk too!

38:38.330 --> 38:42.570
Yeah, looks like I've got my groove back.

38:42.570 --> 38:43.910
What? What happened?

38:44.710 --> 38:46.680
That's Imai from Beni High!

38:46.680 --> 38:47.660
Bastard!

38:47.660 --> 38:49.860
Looks like he hasn't learned his lesson.

38:49.860 --> 38:51.890
Guess we'd better teach it to him again!

38:52.810 --> 38:54.990
I guess those two had company...

38:54.990 --> 38:57.850
And there goes your groove again, Imai.

39:02.890 --> 39:04.730
Hey, what's wrong?

39:06.790 --> 39:09.180
You and Itou...

39:10.150 --> 39:12.770
are persistent little dickheads.

39:13.280 --> 39:15.070
Can't you guys think about your future?

39:15.490 --> 39:19.530
The future doesn't mean shit if I have to get beaten up by some minor league prick.

39:20.640 --> 39:24.030
He's just a pussy-whipped punk, that guy.

39:24.030 --> 39:25.920
Who? You mean Itou?

39:26.510 --> 39:30.010
I suppose a loser like you wouldn't get it, anyway.

39:30.850 --> 39:34.810
What? You telling me you've also got something worth protecting?

39:34.810 --> 39:36.250
Damn straight.

39:36.250 --> 39:37.690
Well, what is it?

39:37.690 --> 39:39.090
Spit it out!

39:40.530 --> 39:42.510
I'm here to protect...

39:45.860 --> 39:47.390
the <i>world</i>.

39:47.750 --> 39:48.660
What the...

39:49.180 --> 39:51.880
Don't tell anyone. It's pretty embarrassing.

39:54.000 --> 39:55.150
Don't screw around with me!

40:03.990 --> 40:09.130
You shouldn't do something cowardly like squirting lemon juice in my eyes, Sagara.

40:09.700 --> 40:13.330
You aren't even in the same league as me when it comes to fighting dirty!

40:15.390 --> 40:19.970
Now, time to avenge Itou!

40:28.550 --> 40:29.690
Mitsuhashi!

40:29.690 --> 40:30.490
Mitsuhashi!

40:31.020 --> 40:31.890
Oh crap.

40:32.410 --> 40:33.320
Take that!

40:37.000 --> 40:39.050
What are <i>you doing here?!</i>

40:39.050 --> 40:40.890
I was watching you.

40:40.890 --> 40:41.910
Over here!

40:52.910 --> 40:54.970
Looks like someone got his face rearranged...

40:57.230 --> 41:00.430
Don't think you've won this...

41:01.510 --> 41:03.270
Sore loser.

41:03.770 --> 41:04.730
Wanna fight?

41:04.730 --> 41:07.230
C'mon, I'll tear you limb from limb.

41:07.740 --> 41:09.400
Come on. What's your problem?

41:09.400 --> 41:13.130
I wouldn't have gone this far.

41:13.130 --> 41:18.160
You're running away 'cause you're scared.
Scared of me and Akehisa!

41:18.160 --> 41:21.230
He's my friend. It's the same as if I'd done it.

41:21.230 --> 41:22.530
What?

41:22.530 --> 41:23.570
Later.

41:24.530 --> 41:26.340
We're going home, Mitsuhashi.

41:35.130 --> 41:40.010
What d'you mean, "same as if I'd done it"?
It was <i>me who brought the pain, not you!</i>

41:40.350 --> 41:45.050
Great. So it's not my responsibility when Akehisa comes looking for payback.

41:45.050 --> 41:46.560
Are these your true colors?

41:46.560 --> 41:48.510
Itou!

41:49.350 --> 41:50.970
Oh no...

41:54.050 --> 41:55.610
I finally found you.

41:55.610 --> 41:57.630
I wasn't fighting.

41:57.630 --> 41:59.700
I promise. Right, Ryou-kun?

41:59.700 --> 42:00.690
Yeah.

42:01.930 --> 42:04.570
That's not why I came to find you.

42:04.570 --> 42:06.650
I've been meaning to give you this.

42:07.460 --> 42:08.160
Here.

42:09.200 --> 42:10.130
Kyou.

42:10.410 --> 42:12.330
Sorry it's late.

42:12.330 --> 42:15.930
I-I should be the one apologizing.

42:15.930 --> 42:20.970
Making you worry and all. If I'd known, I woulda...

42:17.150 --> 42:19.070
You're making a scene in front of everyone!

42:19.070 --> 42:20.970
It's sure getting hot out here.

42:20.970 --> 42:24.170
Hurrah! Congrats!

42:22.750 --> 42:24.170
Shut the fuck up!

42:24.680 --> 42:27.320
What is <i>wrong with you guys?!</i>

42:27.320 --> 42:31.250
Oh, Itou, you're turning soft, aren't ya, fella?

42:31.250 --> 42:32.460
Hey!

42:32.460 --> 42:34.930
Mitsuhashi, I finally found you!

42:34.930 --> 42:37.870
Wait, you didn't drown, Imai?

42:37.870 --> 42:41.930
Mitsuhashi! Let's settle this here and now!

42:41.930 --> 42:43.070
You're so needy!

42:43.070 --> 42:45.160
This is why you can't get girls!

42:46.170 --> 42:48.330
You touched a nerve there!

42:48.330 --> 42:50.850
Anyway, that's besides the point!

42:50.850 --> 42:53.490
Wow, you're always getting knocked about, aren't you?

42:52.250 --> 42:53.860
What an energetic bunch.

42:53.500 --> 42:57.130
Yeah, and it's all your fault, Mitsuhashi.

42:53.860 --> 42:54.800
Shall we get going?

42:54.800 --> 42:57.130
Yeah. Oh, wait a second.

42:57.130 --> 42:58.770
Whatever!

42:58.770 --> 43:01.590
That's the first time anyone's pulled a punk move like that on me!

43:01.590 --> 43:04.850
Mitsuhashi, doesn't that make you a complete bastard?

43:02.670 --> 43:03.490
Thanks for waiting.

43:03.490 --> 43:05.420
What did you do? Riko...

43:05.420 --> 43:07.770
Right, let's get going.

43:07.130 --> 43:08.360
Come on, then! Bring it!

43:08.360 --> 43:09.860
Who're you calling a bastard, you toad?

43:09.860 --> 43:11.290
You deadbeat!

43:11.290 --> 43:12.370
You got something to say?

43:12.370 --> 43:15.820
Whatever! Don't go thinking you'll have Riko all to yourself, dammit!

43:15.820 --> 43:17.550
Wh-What do you mean by that?!

43:17.550 --> 43:19.690
Well, all you think about is sex, Mitsuhashi!

43:19.980 --> 43:23.190
You're the same, Itou, you bastard!

43:33.820 --> 43:33.870
The Crimson Coward Against the Sunset

43:37.840 --> 43:40.040
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

43:40.040 --> 43:42.690
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

43:46.040 --> 43:48.000
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

43:48.000 --> 43:50.530
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

43:54.020 --> 43:56.000
You and me are friends, partner.

43:56.000 --> 43:57.740
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

44:02.000 --> 44:04.080
I help you.

44:02.920 --> 44:04.080
We're family.

44:04.080 --> 44:05.840
I like you.

44:17.960 --> 44:20.000
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

44:20.000 --> 44:22.230
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

44:25.840 --> 44:27.400
That cute girl is mine,

44:27.400 --> 44:30.490
but I belong to no one.

44:33.690 --> 44:35.920
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

44:35.920 --> 44:38.000
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

45:05.980 --> 45:07.920
You and me are friends, partner.

45:07.920 --> 45:09.860
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

45:36.110 --> 45:36.150
See Ya!
